		)
		(uuid "176385ca-4724-5786-b128-bc4aa558e4ec")
	)
	(text "J pins: 1 VCC, 2 GND, 3 Z-C, 4 PSM (module header order).\nZ-C is pulled up to VCC on the module, so VCC must be 3.3 V.\nZ-C filter cap: fit only if edges are noisy."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18703c6d-d104-5b3d-998e-45575d9308e6")
	)
	(text "Not connected on purpose: EN; IO0 (BOOT), IO12, IO15 (strapping);\nIO2 (on-board LED); TX0/RX0 (USB serial); SD0-SD3, CMD, CLK (flash).\nPin map must match include/io_pins.h."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
