	(text "SSR header: pin 1 = SSR(+) at +5 V, pin 2 = SSR(-) to the MOSFET drain. LED (1k, ~3 mA) lights while the SSR input is driven. 10k pull-downs keep every load OFF during\nreset, boot and flashing. Mains side is off-board, e.g. heater: L - SSR - 165 C manual-reset high-limit - thermal fuse - element - N."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "718280eb-e805-5cdb-bbaf-e16240d6692a")
	)
