	)
	(text "5 V power LED: 1k + red LED (~3 mA). D1 stops the DevKit's USB 5 V from\nback-feeding the 5 V rail (and the rail from feeding the USB host). With USB\nonly, the SSRs and pressure sensor are unpowered. DevKit 5V pin = +5V_ESP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3b8c42a-1e6c-5f81-a082-8359b1cfe764")
	)
	(text "GAGGIA SAVANT controller carrier - LOW VOLTAGE ONLY.\nMains parts (5 V supply, SSR load sides, dimmer\ntriac, heater chain) are off-board. No low-voltage\nnet may connect to a mains terminal.\nReference: IO_design.md, include/io_pins.h.\nDNP = do not populate unless needed.\nSMD 0805 passives/LEDs (hand-solder pads);\n2.54 mm headers for all external connections."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b21ad4b1-0532-5abc-922b-4daa00f2782b")
	)
	(text "J pins: 1 = T+, 2 = T-. 10 nF across T+/T- at the chip.\nSupply 3.3 V (abs. max 3.6 V). K-type extension wire, twisted,\naway from heater and mains leads. A grounded probe reads as a\nshort-to-GND fault."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9e713c4-2b9a-517e-b80d-131a0c7ecb57")
	)
	(text "Pins: 3V3 GND DOUT SCK.\nSCK pull-down: HX711 powers\ndown if SCK floats high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e238d02d-c159-5a2a-8d7b-305be8999e90")
	)
	(text "J pins: 1 = 5 V, 2 = GND, 3 = OUT. C at the connector decouples the sensor supply.\nDivider 10k/10k (ratio 0.5): 4.5 V -> 2.25 V. Firmware assumes exactly 0.5: use 1 %.\nPRESSURE goes to GPIO36 and ADS1115 AIN0; the PRESSURE_ADC build option picks one.\nBAT54S clamp (DNP): fit only if the sensor could ever see more than 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e78bb26b-b157-5012-8caa-014a6b500a81")
	)
	(text "ADDR = GND -> address 0x48. AIN0 = PRESSURE (same node as GPIO36).\nAIN1 = 5 V rail / 2 (same 10k/10k ratio): firmware divides AIN0 by AIN1,\nso 5 V supply drift cancels (the XDB401 output is ratiometric).\nBuild option PRESSURE_ADC selects ADS1115 or the ESP32 ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f121daa6-cde7-594f-a5b2-829c9cc750f3")
	)
	(text "IO32 / IO33: ADC1, interrupts, internal pulls (flow meter, tank level).\nIO23: digital (VSPI MOSI).\nIO39: input only, no pulls, no interrupts (errata)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fce04423-81b1-55c3-b45d-dbaaff380237")
	)
